<title>UK: ADtranz wins 34 mlns stg UK order.</title>
<headline>ADtranz wins 34 mlns stg UK order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European rail systems supplier ABB Daimler-Benz Transportation (ADtranz) said on Wednesday its UK unit had won an order to build 12 diesel multiple unit passenger trains for newly-privatised Chiltern Railways.</p>
</text>
